<title>USA: JDN Realty gets $150 mln line of credit.</title>
<headline>JDN Realty gets $150 mln line of credit.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>JDN Realty Corp said Wednesday it had closed on a new $150 million unsecured line of credit which replaces its existing $40 million secured line of credit.</p>
<p>The company said the new credit line will give it financial flexibility to pursue additional development, redevelopment and acquisition activities.</p>
